    "final_answer": "I have all the information needed to complete the task. Let me provide the comparison.\n\n## Latest iPhone Model: iPhone 18 Pro\n\nBased on Apple's website (apple.com), the latest iPhone model is the **iPhone 18 Pro**, which is available in two variants: **iPhone 18 Pro** and **iPhone 18 Pro Max**.\n\n### Comparison: iPhone 18 Pro vs iPhone 18 Pro Max\n\n| Feature | iPhone 18 Pro | iPhone 18 Pro Max |\n|---------|---------------|-------------------|\n| **Screen Size** | 6.3-inch display | 6.9-inch display |\n| **Starting Price (Buy)** | $1,199 | $1,299 |\n| **Monthly Payment** | $49.95/mo. for 24 mo. | $54.12/mo. for 24 mo. |\n| **Lease Price** | $34.99/mo. for 24 mo. | $37.99/mo. for 24 mo. |\n\n### Key Takeaways\n- **Price Difference:** The iPhone 18 Pro Max costs **$100 more** than the iPhone 18 Pro ($1,299 vs $1,199).\n- **Screen Size Difference:** The Pro Max has a **0.6-inch larger display** (6.9\" vs 6.3\"), making it the better choice for users who want a bigger screen.\n\nBoth models share the same Pro-tier features (Apple Intelligence, advanced camera system, etc.), with the Pro Max primarily offering a larger display and longer battery life.",
